(6071867, 893901, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the over-processed B&amp;W treatment.  Like the shot in the sun effect too.  I''m not quite sure what your "essence" is (wanderer? philosopher?), but it''s still a real cool pic with the textures, ripples, foot prints.</td>', 'I like the over-processed B&W treatment.  Like the shot in the sun effect too.  I''m not quite sure what your "essence" is (wanderer? philosopher?), but it''s still a real cool pic with the textures, ripples, foot prints.', '2010-06-28 06:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
