(6071909, 893674, 23484, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colors.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen that tone of yellow in the sky before.</td>', 'Gorgeous colors.  I don''t think I''ve ever seen that tone of yellow in the sky before.', '2010-06-28 08:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
