(6071999, 893664, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh this is just stunning!!</td>', 'Oh this is just stunning!!', '2010-06-28 11:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072000, 893552, 15711, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  The bokeh is wonderful.</td>', 'I really like this.  The bokeh is wonderful.', '2010-06-28 11:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072001, 893779, 15711, '<td valign="top">HAHA  That is great.</td>', 'HAHA  That is great.', '2010-06-28 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072002, 893843, 15711, '<td valign="top">Art is that you?  LOL</td>', 'Art is that you?  LOL', '2010-06-28 11:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072016, 893524, 68947, '<td valign="top">LOL...me too!  It''s been broken more than I care to think about. I had an entry in that had a knife, just like this one and I used red acrylic paint,  mixed with a bit of brown to make it look less red and more like blood. Still came out pretty red though.  One of the comments was, "blood looks fake"!  I had to wonder what they thought it *should* be??? LOL People also took the time to analyze HOW the blood should have been splattered or dripped or whatever.  I still can''t get over that! LOL I''m sure that this one is causing some "gross" comments and likely a lower score because everyone likes "PRETTY" LOL.</td>', 'LOL...me too!  It''s been broken more than I care to think about. I had an entry in that had a knife, just like this one and I used red acrylic paint,  mixed with a bit of brown to make it look less red and more like blood. Still came out pretty red though.  One of the comments was, "blood looks fake"!  I had to wonder what they thought it *should* be??? LOL People also took the time to analyze HOW the blood should have been splattered or dripped or whatever.  I still can''t get over that! LOL I''m sure that this one is causing some "gross" comments and likely a lower score because everyone likes "PRETTY" LOL.', '2010-06-28 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072017, 893753, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really cute :)  It does leave your essence there very well!</td>', 'Really cute :)  It does leave your essence there very well!', '2010-06-28 12:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072019, 893500, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really clever!!!  I''d have never thought of being a neuron before but, we are! LOL  Love the artsy feel to this one too! :)</td>', 'Really clever!!!  I''d have never thought of being a neuron before but, we are! LOL  Love the artsy feel to this one too! :)', '2010-06-28 12:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072027, 893899, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m feeling really stupid right now and may have to come back to re-evaluate (need an "ah-ha moment" here) but, the photo and the title don''t match up in my pea-brain right now LOL.  I somehow can''t match up a drop of water to a stone. ;)  I''m being sarcastically humorous by saying...."A Bit of A Drip" might have suited the photo better! ;)  Actually, in all seriousness, quite a nice photo! :)</td>', 'Ok, I''m feeling really stupid right now and may have to come back to re-evaluate (need an "ah-ha moment" here) but, the photo and the title don''t match up in my pea-brain right now LOL.  I somehow can''t match up a drop of water to a stone. ;)  I''m being sarcastically humorous by saying...."A Bit of A Drip" might have suited the photo better! ;)  Actually, in all seriousness, quite a nice photo! :)', '2010-06-28 12:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072029, 893737, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh....really nice!</td>', 'Ohhhh....really nice!', '2010-06-28 12:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072033, 893552, 68947, '<td valign="top">Don''t we all have our "dark sides" hidden somewhere? :)  Nicely photographed.</td>', 'Don''t we all have our "dark sides" hidden somewhere? :)  Nicely photographed.', '2010-06-28 12:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072034, 893892, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really cute! :)</td>', 'Really cute! :)', '2010-06-28 12:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072037, 893286, 68947, '<td valign="top">Well, that does tell us something about you so, good for you! :)  Cute too with the soccer ball as a face.  Reminds me of Tom Hanks'' ball in "The Castaway".  Just don''t tell me that you''re talking to it!! ;)</td>', 'Well, that does tell us something about you so, good for you! :)  Cute too with the soccer ball as a face.  Reminds me of Tom Hanks'' ball in "The Castaway".  Just don''t tell me that you''re talking to it!! ;)', '2010-06-28 12:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072040, 893487, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up and nice shot!  The edge of the bowl looks like it was in movement (just the top ring).</td>', 'Very nice set up and nice shot!  The edge of the bowl looks like it was in movement (just the top ring).', '2010-06-28 12:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072044, 893864, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice work. Looks kind of like Mono Lake to me. I think you got the gist of this challenge just right--FS with an emphasis on the title :)</td>', 'Nice work. Looks kind of like Mono Lake to me. I think you got the gist of this challenge just right--FS with an emphasis on the title :)', '2010-06-28 12:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072045, 893865, 68947, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL scene!  Nicely shot too!  Certainly conveys the message nicely although, I''d be more inclined to say that a single empty chair might have been more effective.  However, we get the point and I''m sure those chairs were too heavy to move! LOL</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL scene!  Nicely shot too!  Certainly conveys the message nicely although, I''d be more inclined to say that a single empty chair might have been more effective.  However, we get the point and I''m sure those chairs were too heavy to move! LOL', '2010-06-28 12:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072047, 893465, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love the lighting and mood that it sets.  Woody (looks antique...great one!) is posed perfectly!</td>', 'Very nice!  I love the lighting and mood that it sets.  Woody (looks antique...great one!) is posed perfectly!', '2010-06-28 12:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072049, 893773, 17507, '<td valign="top">I have trouble seeing windmills here--I see what looks like a window and a large framed print of an infant. I have no problem with abstract photography, but I''m sensing a disconnect between the photo and the title.</td>', 'I have trouble seeing windmills here--I see what looks like a window and a large framed print of an infant. I have no problem with abstract photography, but I''m sensing a disconnect between the photo and the title.', '2010-06-28 12:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072053, 893902, 68947, '<td valign="top">Interesting....I''m not sure that my "thick skull gets it" though. LOL</td>', 'Interesting....I''m not sure that my "thick skull gets it" though. LOL', '2010-06-28 12:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072054, 893221, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice duckling shot... sharp, good exposure, expressive body language. Since animals are so easily anthropomorphized, I think an animal-less photo would meet the challenge better for me.</td>', 'Nice duckling shot... sharp, good exposure, expressive body language. Since animals are so easily anthropomorphized, I think an animal-less photo would meet the challenge better for me.', '2010-06-28 12:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072056, 893559, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, the bird really blends in nicely with the tree but, stands out enough to see it.</td>', 'Wow, the bird really blends in nicely with the tree but, stands out enough to see it.', '2010-06-28 12:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072057, 893843, 68947, '<td valign="top">PROPS!!! LOL</td>', 'PROPS!!! LOL', '2010-06-28 12:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072059, 893753, 17507, '<td valign="top">Although I''m sure that working as a firefighter gives you a great sense of pride--it''s amazingly difficult and noble work--I think the sense of pride and nobility is undermined by the deflated-looking fire suit.</td>', 'Although I''m sure that working as a firefighter gives you a great sense of pride--it''s amazingly difficult and noble work--I think the sense of pride and nobility is undermined by the deflated-looking fire suit.', '2010-06-28 12:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072060, 893802, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very pretty! :)</td>', 'Very pretty! :)', '2010-06-28 12:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072062, 893462, 68947, '<td valign="top">Extremely pretty.  Love the tones and textures!  (Are you getting the standard "too busy...hurts my eyes" comment? LOL)  Love it!  8</td>', 'Extremely pretty.  Love the tones and textures!  (Are you getting the standard "too busy...hurts my eyes" comment? LOL)  Love it!  8', '2010-06-28 12:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072064, 893857, 17507, '<td valign="top">Works for me--fits the challenge well even without the title. Some noise cleanup on the sky would have helped--if not NeatImage or the like, then some selective gaussian blur to get rid of the artifacts.</td>', 'Works for me--fits the challenge well even without the title. Some noise cleanup on the sky would have helped--if not NeatImage or the like, then some selective gaussian blur to get rid of the artifacts.', '2010-06-28 12:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072065, 893251, 68947, '<td valign="top">Wow, to have the frog looking at the angels face like that is precious!  Made me feel "soft" when I saw it! :)</td>', 'Wow, to have the frog looking at the angels face like that is precious!  Made me feel "soft" when I saw it! :)', '2010-06-28 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072066, 893872, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this will score high.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I''m sure this will score high.  Nicely done!', '2010-06-28 12:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072067, 893887, 68947, '<td valign="top">Almost looks as though it''s smiling at us! :)</td>', 'Almost looks as though it''s smiling at us! :)', '2010-06-28 12:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072069, 892982, 17507, '<td valign="top">Very cool abstract. I don''t understand why you reference a knife in the title, though. It''s a very strong image with great texture and tonal detail, and I think the reference to a knife detracts by introducing confusion.</td>', 'Very cool abstract. I don''t understand why you reference a knife in the title, though. It''s a very strong image with great texture and tonal detail, and I think the reference to a knife detracts by introducing confusion.', '2010-06-28 12:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6072070, 893905, 17507, '<td valign="top">Very nicely exposed and just the right amount of sharp.</td>', 'Very nicely exposed and just the right amount of sharp.', '2010-06-28 12:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
