(6074773, 893552, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great DOF.</td>', 'Great DOF.', '2010-06-30 18:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074774, 893661, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am sure many have commented on the Haloing........I take it that it was intentional.  While many will object to such a processing method, I think instead it is there to both make a statement and to overemphasize the subject.  It does both.........In tying with the title, the halo does give a feel of leadership, of importance, like a lighting around someone who has presence when they walk into the room.  You have, by processing, produced a symbolic way of showing that presence........As a result, you have made a statement which stands out amid the other entries........</td>', 'I am sure many have commented on the Haloing........I take it that it was intentional.  While many will object to such a processing method, I think instead it is there to both make a statement and to overemphasize the subject.  It does both.........In tying with the title, the halo does give a feel of leadership, of importance, like a lighting around someone who has presence when they walk into the room.  You have, by processing, produced a symbolic way of showing that presence........As a result, you have made a statement which stands out amid the other entries........', '2010-06-30 18:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074775, 893831, 96881, '<td valign="top">But why do you have to be.......the insistence of todays society that we should be always on the move and getting to some place, or building to something will sometimes conflict with Life.......We have one shot, and if you are happy where you are, why should you have to be going somewhere else..........<br/>The image is simple......maybe it would have been better with a single boat, but then again, why can''t there be a group of you in the same position...so in many ways, this symbolises 4 people that are going nowhere..........Reflections are good but the sky is what bothers me slightly.....some processing could have made it more menacing........Going nowhere although a storm is approaching.......or blue sky, going nowhere while the sun is shinning........in many ways, as even stronger message could have been put forward...............</td>', 'But why do you have to be.......the insistence of todays society that we should be always on the move and getting to some place, or building to something will sometimes conflict with Life.......We have one shot, and if you are happy where you are, why should you have to be going somewhere else..........The image is simple......maybe it would have been better with a single boat, but then again, why can''t there be a group of you in the same position...so in many ways, this symbolises 4 people that are going nowhere..........Reflections are good but the sky is what bothers me slightly.....some processing could have made it more menacing........Going nowhere although a storm is approaching.......or blue sky, going nowhere while the sun is shinning........in many ways, as even stronger message could have been put forward...............', '2010-06-30 18:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074787, 893247, 118416, '<td valign="top">I like how dark but happy the dog looks. The way his bright face contrasts with the darkness works well. Good job.</td>', 'I like how dark but happy the dog looks. The way his bright face contrasts with the darkness works well. Good job.', '2010-06-30 19:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074910, 893843, 10785, '<td valign="top">Totally best of show! A Blue Ribbon Choice! Essence Captured! This reminds me of a spy v. spy character!!</td>', 'Totally best of show! A Blue Ribbon Choice! Essence Captured! This reminds me of a spy v. spy character!!', '2010-06-30 21:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074914, 893905, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect shot of paper if there ever was one. Nice and white, shadows cast... excellent depth for essentially a 2d subject!</td>', 'This is a perfect shot of paper if there ever was one. Nice and white, shadows cast... excellent depth for essentially a 2d subject!', '2010-06-30 21:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074917, 892915, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is kind of borderline. Pretty much a picture of a picture were it not for the underwater camera housing in front. That object is pretty dark but you got the poster exposed well.</td>', 'This is kind of borderline. Pretty much a picture of a picture were it not for the underwater camera housing in front. That object is pretty dark but you got the poster exposed well.', '2010-06-30 21:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074919, 893826, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good exposure here, but it is somewhat out of focus. It is not quite centered in the frame which throws the composition off. The colors are nice and rich.</td>', 'Good exposure here, but it is somewhat out of focus. It is not quite centered in the frame which throws the composition off. The colors are nice and rich.', '2010-06-30 21:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6074922, 893693, 10785, '<td valign="top">Here the photo is lacking in contrast which leads to dull colors. It has a good island feel and speaks to me about who you are thereby capturing your essence!</td>', 'Here the photo is lacking in contrast which leads to dull colors. It has a good island feel and speaks to me about who you are thereby capturing your essence!', '2010-06-30 21:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
