(6079574, 893848, 24454, '<td valign="top">:)  Actually. . .that is pretty cute.  I wish I had a picture of the setup of this tho.  I have a visual in my mind and it makes me laugh :)</td>', ':)  Actually. . .that is pretty cute.  I wish I had a picture of the setup of this tho.  I have a visual in my mind and it makes me laugh :)', '2010-07-04 11:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079619, 893221, 57726, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting.</td>', 'Superb lighting.', '2010-07-04 12:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079652, 893229, 17507, '<td valign="top">This certainly produces an effective visual. The white shirt was a nice choice--leads the eye well from the dark pant legs.</td>', 'This certainly produces an effective visual. The white shirt was a nice choice--leads the eye well from the dark pant legs.', '2010-07-04 13:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079654, 893756, 17507, '<td valign="top">Very effective way of showing the different sides of yourself in a single frame. Almost seems like a photographic autobiography. The white border is a bit much for me--I think it would have been better at 30 or 50% gray. Also, I see you use Nikon. As a Canon guy, that''s fine with me :)</td>', 'Very effective way of showing the different sides of yourself in a single frame. Almost seems like a photographic autobiography. The white border is a bit much for me--I think it would have been better at 30 or 50% gray. Also, I see you use Nikon. As a Canon guy, that''s fine with me :)', '2010-07-04 13:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079656, 893357, 17507, '<td valign="top">Effectively communicates that you work a job that isn''t easy. I think you could have gotten an even lower angle here, or maybe pulled back a bit--the focal point (pint glass) is pretty low in the frame and could use a bit more breathing room.</td>', 'Effectively communicates that you work a job that isn''t easy. I think you could have gotten an even lower angle here, or maybe pulled back a bit--the focal point (pint glass) is pretty low in the frame and could use a bit more breathing room.', '2010-07-04 13:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079658, 893858, 17507, '<td valign="top">Awesome shallow DOF; makes the feathery bit look almost like smoke. I think this challenge lends itself well to abstracts.</td>', 'Awesome shallow DOF; makes the feathery bit look almost like smoke. I think this challenge lends itself well to abstracts.', '2010-07-04 13:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079665, 893143, 17507, '<td valign="top">This photo reminds me somehow of <a href="//www.vggallery.com/painting/p_0779.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a>. Unbounded from the land below, the bird soars, yet the sky is turbulent like a stormy sea.</td>', 'This photo reminds me somehow of this. Unbounded from the land below, the bird soars, yet the sky is turbulent like a stormy sea.', '2010-07-04 13:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079672, 893906, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice use of monochrome. The clean and minimal graphical presentation suits your subject matter well.</td>', 'Nice use of monochrome. The clean and minimal graphical presentation suits your subject matter well.', '2010-07-04 13:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079675, 893779, 17507, '<td valign="top">Hah! I''m guessing that you don''t have a self-image of being too skinny :P Clever photo.</td>', 'Hah! I''m guessing that you don''t have a self-image of being too skinny :P Clever photo.', '2010-07-04 13:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079681, 893872, 17507, '<td valign="top">Nice use of soft focus. I often dislike thick borders, but I think it works here, especially with your white vignetting. I''m not too keen on the toe of the boot being out of the frame, but this is still overall a strong photo.</td>', 'Nice use of soft focus. I often dislike thick borders, but I think it works here, especially with your white vignetting. I''m not too keen on the toe of the boot being out of the frame, but this is still overall a strong photo.', '2010-07-04 13:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079744, 893882, 110090, '<td valign="top">Great shot on of my favorites in this competition</td>', 'Great shot on of my favorites in this competition', '2010-07-04 15:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6079838, 892790, 116574, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the water droplet.</td>', 'Great shot, love the water droplet.', '2010-07-04 17:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
