(6084181, 893611, 30508, '<td valign="top">Not a single comment on this -- well since you were so kind as to present me with one of your awards, I''ll resolve that.  It''s not quite sharp enough for DPC, but I like the softness - it says something about your personality.  The colors are great, and I really like the nice buttery background.  I think what probably hurt this the most in scoring is the subject placement. The flower''s stem is too strong of a leading line for such a centered composition.  If you had removed the top 1/4 of the image or simply placed the flower in the top-right of the image it probably would have scored better.  Of course, scores aren''t everything and I suspect you are rather fond of this image, as you should be.</td>', 'Not a single comment on this -- well since you were so kind as to present me with one of your awards, I''ll resolve that.  It''s not quite sharp enough for DPC, but I like the softness - it says something about your personality.  The colors are great, and I really like the nice buttery background.  I think what probably hurt this the most in scoring is the subject placement. The flower''s stem is too strong of a leading line for such a centered composition.  If you had removed the top 1/4 of the image or simply placed the flower in the top-right of the image it probably would have scored better.  Of course, scores aren''t everything and I suspect you are rather fond of this image, as you should be.', '2010-07-07 15:01:12.000000', NULL, 0),
