(6955900, 893801, 10785, '<td valign="top"><b>Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>I have humbly accepted the job of commenting on the portfolio of a man who''s mind I lack understanding of. Allow me to say a prayer and dive in!<br/> <br/>Using a composition simultaneously including the Rule of Thirds, the Rule of Threes, a hint of framing and repetition of shape, the subject has a very well defined focal point. The tones of reflected light and dark are deep bringing the viewer deeper into the image in order to connect with a subject shielded by the watery shapes. Yet the subject is actually the guardian of the deep it inhabits!</td>', 'Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!  I have humbly accepted the job of commenting on the portfolio of a man who''s mind I lack understanding of. Allow me to say a prayer and dive in! Using a composition simultaneously including the Rule of Thirds, the Rule of Threes, a hint of framing and repetition of shape, the subject has a very well defined focal point. The tones of reflected light and dark are deep bringing the viewer deeper into the image in order to connect with a subject shielded by the watery shapes. Yet the subject is actually the guardian of the deep it inhabits!', '2013-01-12 19:35:39.000000', NULL, 0),
